### Readiness (usado pelo healthcheck do compose e pelas probes do Kubernetes)
GET {{customerService}}/actuator/health/readiness

### Contrato OpenAPI (Swagger UI: {{customerService}}/swagger-ui/index.html nos perfis local e dev)
GET {{customerService}}/v3/api-docs

# =====================================================================
# Clientes (spec F01-020). Execute em ordem: os ids ficam em variáveis.
# =====================================================================

### Cadastrar cliente (CPF com pontuação, e-mail com maiúsculas: é normalizado)
POST {{customerService}}/api/v1/customers
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: {{correlationId}}

{
  "fullName": "Ana Souza",
  "cpf": "529.982.247-25",
  "email": "Ana@Example.com",
  "phone": "11987654321"
}

> {% client.global.set("customerId", response.body.id); client.global.set("version", response.body.version); %}

### Buscar por ID
GET {{customerService}}/api/v1/customers/{{customerId}}

### Listar: filtro "nome contém", paginado e ordenado por nome
GET {{customerService}}/api/v1/customers?name=souza&page=0&size=20&sort=fullName,asc

### Identificar no checkout por CPF ou por e-mail (exatos)
GET {{customerService}}/api/v1/customers?cpf=52998224725

###
GET {{customerService}}/api/v1/customers?email=ANA@EXAMPLE.COM

### Atualizar dados (exige a version lida; repetir com a mesma version dá 409 CONCURRENT_MODIFICATION)
PUT {{customerService}}/api/v1/customers/{{customerId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Ana Souza Lima",
  "email": "ana.lima@example.com",
  "phone": null,
  "version": {{version}}
}

### Bloquear
POST {{customerService}}/api/v1/customers/{{customerId}}/block
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Suspeita de fraude" }

### Desbloquear
POST {{customerService}}/api/v1/customers/{{customerId}}/unblock

# =====================================================================
# Endereços
# =====================================================================

### Cadastrar endereço (o primeiro vira padrão)
POST {{customerService}}/api/v1/customers/{{customerId}}/addresses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "label": "Casa",
  "zipCode": "01310-100",
  "street": "Avenida Paulista",
  "number": "1000",
  "complement": "Apto 42",
  "district": "Bela Vista",
  "city": "São Paulo",
  "state": "SP"
}

> {% client.global.set("homeId", response.body.id); %}

### Cadastrar segundo endereço
POST {{customerService}}/api/v1/customers/{{customerId}}/addresses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "label": "Trabalho",
  "zipCode": "20040-020",
  "street": "Avenida Rio Branco",
  "number": "S/N",
  "district": "Centro",
  "city": "Rio de Janeiro",
  "state": "RJ"
}

> {% client.global.set("workId", response.body.id); %}

### Listar endereços (padrão primeiro)
GET {{customerService}}/api/v1/customers/{{customerId}}/addresses

### Definir o segundo como padrão
PUT {{customerService}}/api/v1/customers/{{customerId}}/addresses/{{workId}}/default

### Atualizar endereço
PUT {{customerService}}/api/v1/customers/{{customerId}}/addresses/{{homeId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "label": "Casa de praia",
  "zipCode": "11010-000",
  "street": "Avenida Ana Costa",
  "number": "10",
  "district": "Gonzaga",
  "city": "Santos",
  "state": "SP"
}

### Remover o padrão (o mais recente dos restantes assume)
DELETE {{customerService}}/api/v1/customers/{{customerId}}/addresses/{{workId}}

# =====================================================================
# Dados para pedido (consumido pelo sales-service)
# =====================================================================

### Com o endereço padrão
GET {{customerService}}/api/v1/customers/{{customerId}}/order-data

### Com endereço escolhido
GET {{customerService}}/api/v1/customers/{{customerId}}/order-data?addressId={{homeId}}

# =====================================================================
# Erros (ProblemDetail com code, correlationId e timestamp)
# =====================================================================

### CPF inválido: 400 INVALID_CPF
POST {{customerService}}/api/v1/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Teste", "cpf": "529.982.247-24", "email": "teste@example.com" }

### Desativar (INACTIVE é final; depois disso, alterações dão 422 CUSTOMER_INACTIVE)
POST {{customerService}}/api/v1/customers/{{customerId}}/deactivate

### Transição inválida: 409 INVALID_STATUS_TRANSITION
POST {{customerService}}/api/v1/customers/{{customerId}}/unblock

### Versão de API não suportada: 400
GET {{customerService}}/api/v2/customers
